WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:01.042
- [Chantel] Hey.
- Hey.

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:01.897
- Do you just want to stay in tonight?

00:00:01.897 --> 00:00:02.730
- Yeah, let's do it!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.813
- Okay, cool.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.638
(victory music)

00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:16.841
- Oh.

00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:29.040
- [Man] Hey.
- Hey!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.873
- How's it going?
- [Woman] Good!

00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:30.706
Glad you could make it!

00:00:30.706 --> 00:00:33.623
- Yeah, yeah, thanks for having me.

00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:38.020
(phone ringtone)

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.039
(text tone)

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:41.422
- Yes!

00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:44.839
- [Man] No.
- I'm gonna grab some ketchup.

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:50.036
- Don't pick up, don't
pick up, don't pick up,

00:00:50.036 --> 00:00:51.829
don't pick up, don't pick up.

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:53.318
- [Voiceover] Hey, this is my voicemail.

00:00:53.318 --> 00:00:55.657
(woman sighing of relief)
Leave a message.

00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:59.163
(car door opening)

00:00:59.163 --> 00:01:00.172
- You Shane?

00:01:00.172 --> 00:01:01.005
- [Shane] Uh, yep!

00:01:01.005 --> 00:01:02.673
- Mind if I turn the radio on?

00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:03.756
- Uh, please!

00:01:05.363 --> 00:01:08.863
(Shane sighing of relief)

00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:12.797
- Yes!

00:01:12.797 --> 00:01:16.871
(crowd talking simultaneously)

00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:17.737
- Oh, Shane?

00:01:17.737 --> 00:01:20.072
Did you have something you wanted to say?

00:01:20.072 --> 00:01:21.331
- Oh.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.581
Yeah, I got an idea.

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:24.914
- [Woman] Oh, let's hear it.

00:01:30.397 --> 00:01:31.230
(woman heavily sighing)

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.102
- My God, you guys, I
just had the worst day.

00:01:33.102 --> 00:01:36.227
I just really need someone
to unload all my problems on.

00:01:36.227 --> 00:01:37.568
And my boyfriend called me

00:01:37.568 --> 00:01:39.969
and he's like, it's
not feeling it anymore.

00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:42.377
And we had this whole hour
and a half long conversation

00:01:42.377 --> 00:01:45.753
and I need to tell you every
single word that was exchanged.

00:01:45.753 --> 00:01:48.253
I just need someone to listen.

